#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<b>Stylesheets</b>"
"<p>See http://www.w3.org/Style/CSS for further information on cascading "
"style sheets.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Stylblaaie</b>"
"<p>Sien http://www.w3.org/Styl/Css vir verdere informasie op gekaskade Styl "
"velle.</p>"

